AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002387> "x has the potential to develop into y iff x develops into y or if x is capable of developing into y"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002387> "has potential to develop into"@en)
SubObjectPropertyOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002387> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002384>)

