AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002388> "has potential to directly develop into"@en)
SubObjectPropertyOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002388> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002387>)

