AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002479> "p has part that occurs in c if and only if there exists some p1, such that p has_part p1, and p1 occurs in c.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002479> "has part that occurs in")
