AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002507> "s determined by f if and only if s is a type of system, and f is a material entity that is part of s, such that f exerts a strong causal influence on the functioning of s, and the removal of f would cause the collapse of s.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002507> "determined by")
SubObjectPropertyOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002507> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000050>)
